WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.578
"Someone needs help!" Rex said.

2
00:00:09.579 --> 00:00:13.998
The buddies looked.

3
00:00:13.999 --> 00:00:18.136
A log floated by fast.

4
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:23.223
A small rat clung to it.

5
00:00:23.224 --> 00:00:28.899
"Help!" the rat yelled.

6
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:38.750
"We have to help the rat," Sid said.

7
00:00:38.751 --> 00:00:45.396
"But I can't run fast."

8
00:00:45.397 --> 00:00:47.916
Tor felt a raindrop on her face.

9
00:00:47.917 --> 00:00:50.836
"Ugh," she said.

10
00:00:50.837 --> 00:00:57.137
"I can run fast!" Rex said.

11
00:00:57.138 --> 00:01:00.354
He ran after the rat.

12
00:01:00.355 --> 00:01:04.362
But the water moved fast too.

13
00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:10.668
The rat floated away.

14
00:01:10.669 --> 00:01:14.253
"Poor rat!" Rex said.

15
00:01:14.254 --> 00:01:16.134
Swoosh!

16
00:01:16.135 --> 00:01:19.634
Suddenly Tor flew by.

17
00:01:19.635 --> 00:01:23.336
"Go, Tor!" Sara said.

18
00:01:23.337 --> 00:01:27.370
Tor flew over the rat.

19
00:01:27.371 --> 00:01:41.867
She saved him!

20
00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:45.022
A big rat ran over.

21
00:01:45.023 --> 00:01:48.494
He held a really big leaf.

22
00:01:48.495 --> 00:01:52.128
He hugged the small rat.

23
00:01:52.129 --> 00:01:54.567
The big rat looked at Tor.

24
00:01:54.568 --> 00:01:57.796
"You're a hero!" he said.

25
00:01:57.797 --> 00:02:08.949
"A very wet hero," Tor said.

26
00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:12.121
The rat gave Tor his leaf.

27
00:02:12.122 --> 00:02:21.342
Tor smiled. "Thanks!"

